---
/* 구역 1. 공책 그림은 글자가 들어 있어 페이지 글꼴을 쓰도록 인라인 SVG로 둔다(시안 결정). */
---
<section data-component="Hero" id="top" class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <h1 class="hero__title" id="hero-title">
        <span class="line">막힌 곳을 찾아서,</span>
        <span class="line"><span class="mark">틈</span>부터 채웁니다</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">중학생 수학 소수반. 한 반 8명까지만 받고, 수업마다 아이가 어디서 막혔는지 확인합니다.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#apply" data-track="cta_hero_apply">겨울방학 상담 신청하기</a>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="#classes">반 안내 보기</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero__art">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 640 800" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" role="img" aria-labelledby="hero-art-title" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <title id="hero-art-title">수학 공책에 푼 일차방정식. 둘째 줄에 형광펜이 칠해져 있고 '여기서 막힘, 이항할 때 부호'라는 메모가 붙어 있다.</title>
        <defs>
          <pattern id="grid" width="30" height="30" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M30 0H0V30" fill="none" stroke="#DCE2EE" stroke-width="1.5" /></pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="640" height="800" fill="#F1EBDC" />
        <g transform="rotate(-2 320 400)">
          <rect x="76" y="188" width="500" height="440" rx="12" fill="#E3DAC3" />
          <rect x="68" y="180" width="500" height="440" rx="12" fill="#FFFFFF" />
          <rect x="68" y="180" width="500" height="440" rx="12" fill="url(#grid)" />
          <path d="M110 180V620" stroke="#C7D0E2" stroke-width="2" />
          <g fill="#1B2A4A">
            <rect x="92" y="170" width="10" height="22" rx="5" /><rect x="152" y="170" width="10" height="22" rx="5" />
            <rect x="212" y="170" width="10" height="22" rx="5" /><rect x="272" y="170" width="10" height="22" rx="5" />
            <rect x="332" y="170" width="10" height="22" rx="5" /><rect x="392" y="170" width="10" height="22" rx="5" />
            <rect x="452" y="170" width="10" height="22" rx="5" /><rect x="512" y="170" width="10" height="22" rx="5" />
          </g>
          <text x="132" y="240" font-size="22" font-weight="600" fill="#5B667E">일차방정식 풀이</text>
          <rect x="124" y="328" width="262" height="46" rx="4" fill="#FFE066" transform="rotate(-0.8 255 351)" />
          <g font-size="36" font-weight="600" fill="#1B2A4A">
            <text x="132" y="300">3x + 5 = 20</text>
            <text x="132" y="362">3x = 20 – 5</text>{/* U+2212(−)는 Pretendard에 없어 U+2013(–)으로 바꿈 */}
            <text x="132" y="420">3x = 15</text>
            <text x="132" y="480">x = 5</text>
          </g>
          <g font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#5B667E" text-anchor="middle">
            <text x="89" y="298">1</text><text x="89" y="358">2</text><text x="89" y="418">3</text><text x="89" y="478">4</text>
          </g>
          <g transform="translate(396 292) rotate(2)">
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="164" height="86" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#1B2A4A" stroke-width="2" />
            <text x="14" y="36" font-size="26" font-weight="800" fill="#1B2A4A">여기서 막힘</text>
            <text x="14" y="68" font-size="21" font-weight="500" fill="#44506B">이항할 때 부호</text>
          </g>
          <path d="M396 352c-8 2-14 3-20 2" fill="none" stroke="#1B2A4A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <path d="M382 346l-8 8 10 5" fill="none" stroke="#1B2A4A" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          <path d="M132 536h200" stroke="#1B2A4A" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 7" stroke-linecap="round" />
          <text x="132" y="526" font-size="22" font-weight="500" fill="#5B667E">다음 수업은 2번 줄에서 시작</text>
        </g>
        <g transform="rotate(-3 200 720)">
          <rect x="60" y="690" width="400" height="56" rx="6" fill="#EFE5C8" stroke="#C9BFA6" stroke-width="1.5" />
          <g stroke="#7A6F55" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M90 690v16M120 690v22M150 690v16M180 690v22M210 690v16M240 690v22M270 690v16M300 690v22M330 690v16M360 690v22M390 690v16M420 690v22" />
          </g>
        </g>
        <g transform="translate(420 742) rotate(-20)">
          <rect x="0" y="-12" width="150" height="24" fill="#2E4A7A" />
          <rect x="-18" y="-12" width="18" height="24" fill="#B9C2D3" />
          <rect x="-36" y="-12" width="18" height="24" rx="4" fill="#D9A3A3" />
          <path d="M150 -12L196 0L150 12Z" fill="#E7C99B" />
          <path d="M182 -4L196 0L182 4Z" fill="#1B2A4A" />
        </g>
        <rect x="470" y="60" width="86" height="40" rx="8" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#C9BFA6" stroke-width="1.5" transform="rotate(8 513 80)" />
        <rect x="470" y="60" width="38" height="40" rx="8" fill="#2E4A7A" transform="rotate(8 513 80)" />
      </svg>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
